{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"086b385f-a8a0-4d6a-a3d9-24530563d29a","step":{"id":"s1","script":"On the unit circle, an angle locates a point. Its vertical coordinate becomes the height of the sine wave.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"circle","region":"left","frame":{"x":[-1.4,1.4],"y":[-1.4,1.4],"axes":"origin","equal_scale":true,"x_label":"x","y_label":"y"},"marks":[{"kind":"circle","id":"unit","center":[0,0],"r":1},{"kind":"point","id":"origin","at":[0,0]},{"kind":"point","id":"moving","at":[0.8660254,0.5],"label":"P"},{"kind":"segment","id":"radius","from":{"at":"origin"},"to":{"at":"moving"}},{"kind":"segment","from":{"at":"moving"},"to":[0.8660254,0],"stroke":"dashed","label":"sin θ"},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"origin"},"from":[1,0],"to":{"at":"moving"},"r":0.2,"label":"θ"}]},{"op":"figure","id":"wave","region":"right","frame":{"x":[0,6.6],"y":[-1.4,1.4],"axes":"edge","x_label":"θ (radians)","y_label":"sin θ"},"marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"sample","at":[0.5235988,0.5]},{"kind":"segment","from":[0.5235988,0],"to":{"at":"sample"},"stroke":"dashed","label":"1/2"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"086b385f-a8a0-4d6a-a3d9-24530563d29a","step":{"id":"s2","script":"As the point rotates counterclockwise, plot its height against the angle in radians. One full turn produces one complete sine wave.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"rotation","on":"circle","marks":[{"kind":"arc","center":[0,0],"r":1.18,"start":0,"end":340,"arrow":true}]},{"op":"figure","id":"trace","on":"wave","marks":[{"kind":"fn","id":"sine","y":"sin(x)","domain":[0,6.2831853]},{"kind":"point","id":"start","at":{"on":"sine","x":0}},{"kind":"point","id":"half","at":{"on":"sine","x":3.14159265},"label":"π"},{"kind":"point","id":"finish","at":{"on":"sine","x":6.2831853},"label":"2π"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"rule","anchor":{"el":"wave","side":"below","gap":0.04},"latex":"y=\\sin\\theta,\\qquad \\sin(\\theta+2\\pi)=\\sin\\theta"}],"checkpoint":null}}
